      ],
      "messages": {
        "202430000": {
          "id": 202430000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}, I was just at the beach and picked up some more sound samples",
          "next": [
            202430001
          ]
        },
        "202430001": {
          "id": 202430001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Like coconuts rolling on the ground, soda fizzing and bubbling, squid sizzling on a hotplate...",
          "next": [
            202430002
          ]
        },
        "202430002": {
          "id": 202430002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Your friend is typing...",
          "next": [
            202430003,
            202430005
          ]
        },
        "202430003": {
          "id": 202430003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Now you've got me hungry. I could go for two skewers of squid",
          "next": [
            202430004
          ]
        },
        "202430004": {
          "id": 202430004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Honestly, me too...",
          "next": [
            202430006
          ]
        },
        "202430005": {
          "id": 202430005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "This music smells so good... I mean, this squid sounds amazing",
          "next": [
            202430006
          ]
        },
        "202430006": {
          "id": 202430006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Haha, compared to the blank I get when I have no inspiration, this flavor kick really wakes me up",
          "next": [
            202430007
          ]
        },
        "202430007": {
          "id": 202430007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Actually, I've got some other sound clips with more of that seaside vibe. Here",
          "next": [
            202430008
          ]
        },
        "202430008": {
          "id": 202430008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "This one's when the tide pulling back: shhhh-shalala — glug-glug-glug-glug—",
          "next": [
            202430009
          ]
        },
        "202430009": {
          "id": 202430009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Voice message converted to text (vocal fry detected)",
          "next": [
            202430010
          ]
        },
        "202430010": {
          "id": 202430010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "When sea breeze blows through a rusty anchor: whoosh — hum — whoosh — hum—",
          "next": [
            202430011
          ]
        },
        "202430011": {
          "id": 202430011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Voice message converted to text (deep voice detected)",
          "next": [
            202430012
          ]
        },
        "202430012": {
          "id": 202430012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Seagulls flying by: swish — rustle — hoot — hoot — AH!",
          "next": [
            202430013
          ]
        },
        "202430013": {
          "id": 202430013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Voice message converted to text (bird calls detected)",
          "next": [
            202430014
          ]
        },
        "202430014": {
          "id": 202430014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Sorry, that \"AH!\" was me... A seagull just snagged the snack right out of my hand...",
          "next": [
            202430015
          ]
        },
        "202430015": {
          "id": 202430015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "I've got enough samples now, but it still feels like something's missing... something that \"hits you right in the soul\"",
          "next": [
            202430016
          ]
        },
        "202430016": {
          "id": 202430016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}, do you happen to have any sound ideas that could perk someone up in an instant?",
          "next": [
            202430017,
            202430020,
            202430024
          ]
        },
        "202430017": {
          "id": 202430017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Listen to the Express bellow as it warps!",
          "next": [
            202430018
          ]
        },
        "202430018": {
          "id": 202430018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Recipient has received attachment \"Warp Bellow.mp3\"",
          "next": [
            202430019
          ]
        },
        "202430019": {
          "id": 202430019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "The voice of the Trailblaze really does strike something deep in the heart",
          "next": [
            202430027
          ]
        },
        "202430020": {
          "id": 202430020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Listen to the morning wake-up alarm!",
          "next": [
            202430021
          ]
        },
        "202430021": {
          "id": 202430021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Recipient has received attachment \"Morning Wake-Up Alarm.mp3\"",
          "next": [
            202430022
          ]
        },
        "202430022": {
          "id": 202430022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Mini heart attack... that's one way to hit right in the soul, I suppose",
          "next": [
            202430023
          ]
        },
        "202430023": {
          "id": 202430023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "But for the sake of our listeners' well-being, better take it down an octave",
          "next": [
            202430027
          ]
        },
        "202430024": {
          "id": 202430024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Feast your ears on my soulful singing!",
          "next": [
            202430025
          ]
        },
        "202430025": {
          "id": 202430025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Recipient has received attachment \"Singing in the Shower.mp3\"",
          "next": [
            202430026
          ]
        },
        "202430026": {
          "id": 202430026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Is this your singing? Definitely... hits right in the soul",
          "next": [
            202430027
          ]
        },
        "202430027": {
          "id": 202430027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Hmm... I think I can try mixing this together!",
          "next": [
            202430028
          ]
        },
        "202430028": {
          "id": 202430028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Wing it now! Cast aside the unchanging score. Swing now! We aren't bolted parts anymore...",
          "next": [
            202430029
          ]
        },
        "202430029": {
          "id": 202430029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Voice message converted to text (original vocals detected)",
          "next": [
            202430030
          ]
        },
        "202430030": {
          "id": 202430030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "The <i>Only by Chasing the Wind</i> remix. With that \"soul-hitting\" sample and the seaside breeze backing track, doesn't it feel like a full-on summer vibe now?",
          "next": [
            202430031
          ]
        },
        "202430031": {
          "id": 202430031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Oh! Inspiration just hit. I'm heading back to the recording studio",
          "next": [
            202430032
          ]
        },
        "202430032": {
          "id": 202430032,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Thanks for all your wonderful ideas!",
          "next": [
            202430033
          ]
        },
